=== Data ===
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
{{TitleProperty|Base}}
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
* {{PropertyData|Source|Link}}: The shape to mirror.
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
{{TitleProperty|Plane}}
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
* {{PropertyData|Base|Vector}}: The base point of the mirror plane.
* {{PropertyData|Normal|Vector}}: The normal of the mirror plane.
* {{PropertyData|Mirror Plane|LinkSub}}: Link to the mirror plane reference. Overrides {{PropertyData|Base}} and {{PropertyData|Normal}} if set.
</div>


